<title>TURKEY: RESEARCH ALERT - Migros Turk starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Migros Turk starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Caspian Securities said analysts Milto Goulandris and Murat Bahcivanoglu had started coverage of Turkish supermarket chain Migros Turk AS with a rating of sell.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Despite Migros' historical status as a core holding in any diversified Turkish portfolio, we believe that the current share price overstates the company's forecast performance,&quot; they wrote in a Feb 13 report.</p>
<p>-- The analysts set a 12-month price target of $1.17 a share, representing a dollar return of 5.4 percent.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
